{"id":"00568","root":"uni00568_1","name":{"ja":"まり首領","en":"Boss Mari"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"まり首領","en":"Boss Mari"},"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2022-03-25","limited":true,"characterId":333,"profile":{"ja":"次元侵略者・ブレインフレーヤーによって支配された終末世界の篠原まり。元対魔忍たちで結成された組織“Bandit”の首領を務め、対魔忍の育成などにも力を入れている。彼女は対魔殺法を極めた上、土遁の術を覚醒させており、超人的な身体能力状態を日常的に発揮できるようになった。周囲10キロを移動する陸上の者を振動から感知することができ、その気になれば地震を起こすこともできる。昔はドジっ子であったが、死線を潜り抜けて色々な経験を積んだことにより、誰からも憧れられる対魔忍となった。しかし、かつての仲間の中には闇に堕ちた者も多くいる。まりは彼らを救い出したいと考えている。","en":"She is Shinohara Mari from a post-apocalyptic world dominated by the dimensional invader Brain Flayer. As the leader of \"Bandit\", an organization formed by former Taimanin, she is dedicated to training Taimanin and other endeavors. She has mastered the art of Taimanin assassination and awakened her earth manipulation technique, allowing her to exhibit superhuman physical abilities on a daily basis. She can detect vibrations from anyone moving on land within a 10-kilometer radius and can even cause earthquakes if she chooses to. Although she was once clumsy, her experiences and near-death encounters have transformed her into a Taimanin admired by many. However, some of her former comrades have fallen into darkness, and she hopes to rescue them."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00568_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1346,2692],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[241,482],"def":[152,304],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","1410001"]},{"id":"uni00568_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1892,3784],"sp":[290,290],"atk":[382,764],"def":[204,408],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","1410001","1410002"]},{"id":"uni00568_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2438,4879],"sp":[310,310],"atk":[523,1048],"def":[256,513],"spd":[72,72],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills"